      "message": "@fangkaiyu1783@phytium.com.cn The challenge with using a template here is that constructing the URI with a different scheme requires stripping the existing scheme from ${LDAP_SERVER_URI}and then prepending the test scheme — this can\u0027t be passed as a simple parameter like the port value in Create LDAP Config With Various Port Numbers. The port template works because appending :${port_value} to the base URI is straightforward.",
